  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 45997371392
    m_Localized: 'Each card contains information such as cost, effect, and type.

      The
      card''s type is shown at the top right, and each character has three different
      types.

      You can use a card by dragging it onto a target.

      You can
      end your turn at any time by pressing the Turn End button.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168156475392
    m_Localized: 'Click a character icon at the top to view

      the cards currently
      held by that character


      Cost is restored and your Cards in hand are

      refilled
      at the start of each turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186011627520
    m_Localized: "In the upper-right corner map button \nlets you view your current
      progress on the minimap,\nwith Card book and Settings buttons beside it\n\nAt
      the writing style button,\nyou can use Ink obtained from battles to upgrade
      abilities"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 200611999744
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4084201959424
    m_Localized: ': Attack and Defense

      : In Guard state,  immune to damage

      :
      In Stunned state, cannot act

      : Buffs or Debuffs'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3748351455232
    m_Localized: 'Cards and enemies can have various effects

      Effects affecting
      a target are displayed below its HP bar'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 220631412736
    m_Localized: 'The types of nodes available at each stage are as follows


      Battle:
      Fight enemies to obtain <color=blue>Ink</color>

      Rest: Recover <color=orange>damage
      taken in battle and remove cards</color>

      Event: Gain <color=green> buffs/debuffs</color>
      through unexpected event

      Elite: Encounter <color=red>powerful enemies</color>
      designated for each stage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 232937500672
    m_Localized: 55
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 243196768256
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276424044544
    m_Localized: "Congratulations! You have cleared all currently implemented stages.\nIf
      you start the adventure again, you can play with new cards.\nThank you for
      playing \u2014 we hope you had a great time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592599068672
    m_Localized: 'Card Types

      <sprite=1>: Flame          <sprite=2>: Frost          
      <sprite=0>: Nature

      <sprite=4>: Prayer     <sprite=5>: Holy Power    
      <sprite=3>: Baptism

      <sprite=7>: Slash          <sprite=8>: Strike        
      <sprite=6>: Guard'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 891279650816
    m_Localized: 'Each card type has a corresponding type

      that enhances effects
      when used in sequence.


      current and synergy targets are highlighted
      with a glowing effect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
